    "Sample cards for #demo. Loaded into memory only — never written to storage,",
    "never mixed with real cards, and cleared the moment you leave the demo.",
    "",
    "Every identifier here is invented, but each one satisfies its jurisdiction's",
    "real check-digit rule. That matters: a demo whose validation badges all read",
    "red would teach the opposite of what the app does. The names are deliberately",
    "obvious ('DEMO', 'EJEMPLO') so nothing here can be mistaken for a real entity.",
    "",
    "Check digits solved with js/engines.js — see tools/validate.py for the gate."
